<div type="jPoliticalNews">                         <head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#fr">Spani&#x017F;che</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">Affairen.</hi></hi></head>                 <lb/>
<div type="jArticle">                     <dateline><hi rendition="#fr">Madrit/</hi> den 2. Augu&#x017F;t.</dateline><p> Der Marquis                         de<lb/>
